{
  "title": "Jaclyn Pole Climb",
  "indexDescription": "Jaclyn climbing a pole on Manzanita beach.",
  "description": "The Flennikens and Bovee's vacationed together at Manzanita in 2019.  The pole climbing took place after dinner on the beach.  \n\nWe often head to the beach after dinner to play frisbee or bocce ball, take pictures (the blue hour), walk and to watch the sun set.  The weather was great this evening. \n\nJaclyn had an urge to climb the pole on the beach and I happened to be there to photograph it.  This is something I would expect of Adie not Jaclyn.  She did a great job and barefoot at that. ",
